<![CDATA[<h1>Ubuntu下载及安装</h1><p>作者：WuSi（）</p>
        
          <p>（复制了自己以前的文章）</p>
<h2 id="ubuntu下载及安装实体机">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#ubuntu%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bd%e5%8f%8a%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85%e5%ae%9e%e4%bd%93%e6%9c%ba"></a>
<strong>Ubuntu下载及安装（实体机）</strong>
</h2><h3 id="造锅下载">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%80%a0%e9%94%85%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bd"></a>
**造锅：**<strong>下载</strong>
</h3><p>下载网址(一种即可):</p>
<p><a href="https://mirror.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu-releases/">https://mirror.tuna.tsinghua.edu.cn/ubuntu-releases/</a>清华大学开源软件镜像站 （速度较快）</p>
<p><a href="https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/ubuntu-releases/">https://mirrors.ustc.edu.cn/ubuntu-releases/</a>中科大开源软件镜像站</p>
<p>以为清华站为例:</p>
<p>选择版本，这里我选择20.04(因为Ubuntu20.04较稳定好用)。单击20.04进入，然后选择ubuntu-20.04.6-live-server-amd64.iso下载</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image1.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image1.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_256"
  />
</a></p>
<p>下载完成后找一个2G以上的可移动存储介质(如U盘，移动硬盘，最好找个速度快的)并插入计算机</p>
<p>下载Win32DiskImger:直接百度搜索就行</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image2.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image2.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_257"
  />
</a></p>
<p>点击“映像文件”中的文件夹图标，再切换过滤文件类型(“打开”按钮上面，单击然后选择“.”）然后选择刚才下载的映像，如图</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image3.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image3.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_258"
  />
</a></p>
<p>然后在“设备”中选择可移动介质的盘符，点击写入，等待写入完成</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image4.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image4.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_259"
  />
</a></p>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image5.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image5.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_260"
  />
</a></p>
<p>直到这样就好了</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image6.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image6.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_261"
  />
</a></p>
<p>把可移动介质弹出并拔下，本步骤完成！</p>
<h3 id="起锅安装">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%b5%b7%e9%94%85%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85"></a>
<strong>起锅:安装</strong>
</h3><p><strong>警告：要安装Ubuntu的机器的磁盘将会被清除，请提前做好备份</strong></p>
<p>在要安装Ubuntu的机器中插入U盘，进入BIOS选择自己的U盘启动(都会吧)，热键查询：</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image7.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image7.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_262"
  />
</a></p>
<p>安装过程中(不管哪一步)出现如图情况，请用上下方向键把光标移到[Restart the installer](重启安装程序)并回车</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image8.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image8.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_263"
  />
</a></p>
<p>重启后会进入系统安装程序，如图界面会持续较长时间（电脑配置与加载时间成正比）,此外还有其他界面出现。</p>
<hr>
<p><a
  href="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image9.webp"
  data-fancybox="gallery">
  <img
    class="lazyload"
    data-src="/images/ubuntu_install_files/image9.webp"
    data-sizes="auto"
    alt="IMG_264"
  />
</a></p>
        
